OL,3,GNEWSAMinimum wage 'too high for some
OL,4,Asectors'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey's current minimum wage level is
OL,7,Ftoo high for some sectors and a rise
OL,8,Fwould increase their costs, the
OL,9,Feconomic development minister has said.
OL,11,FDeputy Gerald Voisin's views on the
OL,12,Fminimum wage were recently in the
OL,13,Fspotlight after he wrote an article
OL,14,Fsaying it was "strangling the economy".
OL,16,FIn the States Assembly on Tuesday, he
OL,17,Fwas asked if he would consider lowering
OL,18,Fthe minimum wage in light of his
OL,19,Fcomments.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
