OL,3,GNEWSAMinimum wage 'too high for some
OL,4,Asectors'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said he and the social security
OL,7,Fminister would wait for the Employment
OL,8,FForum to complete its consultation on
OL,9,Fwhat the rate should be in 2027, and
OL,10,Falso he had not ordered any
OL,11,Finvestigation into lowering or
OL,12,Fabolishing the minimum wage.
